# PUSU live cron — DONCHIAN-ONLY (2026-06-16). Apply on VM: crontab dag/crontab (verify: crontab -l)
# All other streams retired (UI + DB + live): MAIN(:01), IMPULSE(:02), halftp_monitor(*/5)
# removed — see sync/donchian/RETIRED_STREAMS_REPORT.md.
#
# Bar-aligned firing (2026-06-19): each emit runs exactly 10s after its bar closes. Cron has
# no sub-minute field, so we fire on the boundary minute and `sleep 10`. The directional
# entry-confirm gate (ENTRY_CONFIRM_BUF) still defers emission of a breakout until it confirms
# on a later run within the lookback window — the +10s alignment just pins each run to the
# period boundary instead of a full minute late.
#
# DONCHIAN live emit (HH:00:10, hourly) — Donchian(55) breakout, ER>=0.35 strong-trend
#   gate (mode='donchian'). Emits on freshly-closed 1h bars and sends a DONCHIAN-labelled
#   Telegram alert per new signal.
0 * * * * sleep 10 && cd $HOME/ict-trade && $HOME/ict-trade/.venv/bin/python sync/donchian/canli.py --emit >> $HOME/ict-donchian.log 2>&1
# DONCHIAN 30m+4h HYBRID live emit (HH:00:10 and HH:30:10) — 30m breakout confirmed by 4h trend
#   direction (mode='dch30_4h'). Best stream overall (+1106R / 2024-26). The plain-30m and
#   ½TP streams were removed 2026-06-17 (see sync/donchian/).
0,30 * * * * sleep 10 && cd $HOME/ict-trade && $HOME/ict-trade/.venv/bin/python sync/donchian/canli.py --emit --tf 30m --confirm-htf 4h >> $HOME/ict-donchian.log 2>&1
# DONCHIAN 30m+4h · 6R live emit (HH:00:10 and HH:30:10) — same hybrid signals, wider 6R target
#   (mode='dch30_4h6'). MFE-validated: ~2x R/trade vs 4R, OOS-robust across 2024-26.
0,30 * * * * sleep 10 && cd $HOME/ict-trade && $HOME/ict-trade/.venv/bin/python sync/donchian/canli.py --emit --tf 30m --confirm-htf 4h --rr 6 >> $HOME/ict-donchian.log 2>&1
# Daily resolve: donchian live signals -> backtest trading_signals (version='donchian' +
#   'dch30_4h' + 'dch30_4h6' + 'd30_4h_so') via sync_daily ACTIVE_STREAMS; also self-heals the
#   live table (prune_live deletes signals that failed directional confirmation).
30 0 * * * cd $HOME/ict-trade && $HOME/ict-trade/.venv/bin/python sync/sync_daily.py --stream all >> $HOME/ict-sync.log 2>&1
